{"id":10028494487837,"title":"Tuna Can Watch Case 46.5mm Stainless Steel Tuna Style Watch Case Sapphire 4 o'clock Crown Fit NH34 NH35 NH36 NH38 20ATM Waterproof Ceramic Bezel","handle":"tuna-can-watch-case-46-5mm","description":"\u003cdiv id=\"nav-description\" style=\"font-family: 'TT Norms Pro', 'Open Sans', Roboto, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif, SimSun; font-size: 14px; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; text-align: start; white-space: normal; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); margin: -156px 0px 0px 0px; padding: 156px 0px 0px 0px; box-sizing: border-box;\" class=\"description--wrap--LscZ0He\" align=\"start\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; position: relative; box-sizing: border-box;\" class=\"extend--wrap--yXwoDbO\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; overflow: hidden; position: relative; box-sizing: border-box;\" class=\"extend--content--VuIQZia\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; box-sizing: border-box;\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv id=\"product-description\" style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; max-width: 944px; overflow: hidden; position: relative; box-sizing: border-box;\" class=\"description--product-description--Mjtql28\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; box-sizing: border-box;\" class=\"description--origin-part--rWy05pE\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; box-sizing: content-box;\" class=\"detailmodule_html\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; box-sizing: content-box;\" class=\"detail-desc-decorate-richtext\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv id=\"ds_div\" style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; box-sizing: content-box;\"\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThis 46.5mm Tuna Can Watch Case stainless steel delivers professional-grade construction for serious horology enthusiasts. The iconic tuna-style design combines robust functionality with distinctive aesthetics, while the sapphire crystal resists scratches and maintains clarity. Engineered for NH34, NH35, NH36, and NH38 movements, it accommodates popular automatic calibers seamlessly. The 4 o'clock crown positioning offers ergonomic winding and adjustment, and the ceramic bezel ensures durability against daily wear. With 20ATM water resistance, this case handles diving and water sports confidently. An excellent foundation for custom builds or restoration projects demanding reliability and precision.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch3 data-end=\"267\" data-start=\"247\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-end=\"267\" data-start=\"251\"\u003eKey Features\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cul data-end=\"1084\" data-start=\"268\"\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"380\" data-start=\"268\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"380\" data-start=\"270\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-end=\"307\" data-start=\"270\"\u003ePremium 316L Stainless Steel Case\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cbr data-end=\"310\" data-start=\"307\"\u003eDurable, corrosion-resistant, and designed in the iconic Tuna style.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"465\" data-start=\"382\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"465\" data-start=\"384\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-end=\"410\" data-start=\"384\"\u003eLarge 46.5mm Case Size\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cbr data-end=\"413\" data-start=\"410\"\u003eBold wrist presence with a solid and rugged build.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"569\" data-start=\"467\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"569\" data-start=\"469\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-end=\"499\" data-start=\"469\"\u003e4 o’clock Screw-Down Crown\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cbr data-end=\"502\" data-start=\"499\"\u003eEnhances comfort while improving water resistance and durability.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"663\" data-start=\"571\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"663\" data-start=\"573\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-end=\"593\" data-start=\"573\"\u003eSapphire Crystal\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cbr data-end=\"596\" data-start=\"593\"\u003eHighly scratch-resistant clear sapphire for long-lasting clarity.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"766\" data-star